Base Camp Dismantle
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to Dismantle (Tent)
    Actions
        Unit - Remove (Triggering unit) from the game
        Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of (Triggering unit))
        Item - Create Tent at VarPoint
        Sound - Play TentDismantle <gen> at 100.00% volume, located at VarPoint with Z offset 0.00
